                <pb facs="0923" n="835" xml:id="pg835"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Leishman to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Pera</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1903-12-22"><hi
                                rendition="#italic">December 22,
                    1903</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Leishman reports that the admiral has informed him that the local governor
                    officially called upon the American consul at Alexandretta and expressed proper
                    regrets, and that the incident may now be considered as closed.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
